{"content":[{"c":["ENDOR"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Ancient Canaanite city, four miles (6.5 kilometers) south of Mt Tabor, assigned to the tribe of Manasseh, though never fully taken by them (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.17.11","r":"Josh.17.11","rawR":"Josh.17.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.17.11","value":"Josh.17.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 17:11"},"). The city witnessed the defeat of Jabin and Sisera by Barak (",{"href":"?bref=Ps.83.9-10","r":"Ps.83.9-10","rawR":"Ps.83.9-10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.83.9-10","value":"Ps.83.9-10"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ps 83:9-10"},"). Endor is best known as the dwelling place of the witch who was called upon by King Saul (",{"href":"?bref=1Sam.28.7","r":"1Sam.28.7","rawR":"1Sam.28.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Sam.28.7","value":"1Sam.28.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Sm 28:7"},"). On that occasion, Saul disguised himself because his journey to Endor took him near the Philistine army encamped at Shunem."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Endor","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jos 17:11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.17.11","rawQueryValue":"Josh.17.11","sourceRefExact":"Josh.17.11"},{"anchorText":"Ps 83:9-10","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ps.83.9-10","rawQueryValue":"Ps.83.9-10","sourceRefExact":"Ps.83.9-10"},{"anchorText":"1 Sm 28:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Sam.28.7","rawQueryValue":"1Sam.28.7","sourceRefExact":"1Sam.28.7"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"bd6fa7af6a066a66603df2190c0e8818f31ab3da8f9fb4495a6db4ea7001478c","sourceItemName":"Endor","sourceItemOrder":168,"sourceMember":"Articles/E.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Endor","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Endor","title":"Endor","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}